## Hypha workflow — skill routing table

Canonical skills live in `.agents/skills/`. Cursor slash commands (`.cursor/skills/henergy-*/`) are thin
wrappers to the same files — use either `/henergy-*` or the natural-language triggers below. Read the
matching skill file and follow it.

| When the person… | Skill file | Procedure |
|---|---|---|
| makes **first contact** / says hi / no goal yet | [`henergy-start`](../../.agents/skills/henergy-start/SKILL.md) | [`workflow/get-started.md`](../../workflow/get-started.md) |
| wants **dev config setup** / no `AGENTS.local.md` | [`henergy-dev-setup`](../../.agents/skills/henergy-dev-setup/SKILL.md) | [`workflow/personal-config.md`](../../workflow/personal-config.md) |
| **starts** a new unit of work ("I'm starting #X") | [`henergy-task-init`](../../.agents/skills/henergy-task-init/SKILL.md) | [`workflow/task-init.md`](../../workflow/task-init.md) |
| **resumes** in-progress work ("I'm continuing #X") | [`henergy-task-resume`](../../.agents/skills/henergy-task-resume/SKILL.md) | [`workflow/task-resume.md`](../../workflow/task-resume.md) |
| **wraps up** / records progress | [`henergy-checkpoint`](../../.agents/skills/henergy-checkpoint/SKILL.md) | [`workflow/checkpoint.md`](../../workflow/checkpoint.md) |
| reads/updates **GitHub** board/issues (technical, opted-in) | [`henergy-board`](../../.agents/skills/henergy-board/SKILL.md) | [`workflow/github-sync.md`](../../workflow/github-sync.md) |
| needs **local context refreshed** | [`henergy-update-context`](../../.agents/skills/henergy-update-context/SKILL.md) | [`workflow/sync-context.md`](../../workflow/sync-context.md) |

Always read the developer's `AGENTS.local.md` in cascade order (root general →
`progress/members/<username>/`) and state the review mode and decision posture being used —
never silently.
